Package: coreval
Title: Evaluate CDISC Open Rules (CORE) Conformance Against SDTM Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Hrach", "Gevorgyan", email = "hrach.gevorgyan@yandex.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Reads SDTM datasets (XPT/sas7bdat/CSV) and evaluates CDISC Open
    Rules (CORE) conformance rules against them, returning findings as a
    tidy data frame. Rule definitions ship inside the package as data,
    extracted from the CDISC Open Rules repository. Not affiliated with or
    endorsed by CDISC, and not a CORE-certified engine.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    data.table,
    haven
Suggests:
    xml2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
